            <ArticleTitle>Planar lithium silolide: aromaticity, with significant contribution of non-classical resonance structures.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>11064-11067</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7cc07004g</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The first planar lithium silolide characterized by X-ray crystallography is reported. The structural data, NMR and DFT results reveal high aromatic character, with the unusual dominance of non-classical resonance structures.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
